#: ../../source/docs/follow-mode.rst:5 0f59ea2353054b20bb1f428f394ecfe8
msgid "Follow Mode"
msgstr "Follow 模式"

#: ../../source/docs/follow-mode.rst:10 142529f26b674f7790e7cf35ba09641c
msgid ""
"When switched into Follow, the vehicle will attempt to follow another "
"vehicle (or anything publishing its position) at a specified offset.  The "
"vehicle lead vehicle's position must be published to the vehicle in Follow "
"mode using a telemetry system."
msgstr ""
"切换至 Follow 模式后，飞行器将尝试以指定偏移量跟随另一飞行器（或任何发布其位置的对象）。目标飞行器的位置必须通过数传系统发布给处于 Follow"
" 模式的飞行器。"

#: ../../source/docs/follow-mode.rst:12 8b9ead096e06467a835c106477fb9aca
msgid ""
"Although Follow mode can use standard ``global-position-int`` MAVLink "
"messages from the lead vehicle, it generally works better if the lead "
"vehicle publishes a ``FOLLOW_TARGET`` MAVLink message. This can be done by "
"running the `follow-target-send.lua "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/blob/master/libraries/AP_Scripting/applets/follow-"
"target-send.lua>`__ Lua script on the lead vehicle."
msgstr ""
"尽管 Follow 模式可以使用来自前导飞行器的标准 ``global-position-int`` MAVLink 消息，但如果前导飞行器发布 "
"``FOLLOW_TARGET`` MAVLink 消息，效果通常更好。这可以通过在前导飞行器上运行 `follow-target-send.lua "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/blob/master/libraries/AP_Scripting/applets/follow-"
"target-send.lua>`__ Lua 脚本实现。"

#: ../../source/docs/follow-mode.rst:14 cf55f99c68ff4f8a87369d5ea7148995
#, no-python-format
msgid ""
"The altitude is maintained with the altitude hold controller so the vehicle "
"will attempt to hold its current altitude when the sticks are placed with "
"10% of mid-throttle. It will climb or descend at up to 2.5m/s (this speed is"
" adjustable with the :ref:`PILOT_SPD_UP<PILOT_SPD_UP>` and "
":ref:`PILOT_SPD_DN<PILOT_SPD_DN>` parameters). The acceleration used to "
"establish these speeds is set by :ref:`PILOT_ACC_Z<PILOT_ACC_Z>`."
msgstr ""
"高度由定高控制器维持，因此当摇杆位于中位油门 10% 范围内时，飞行器会尝试保持当前高度。它将以最高 2.5m/s 爬升或下降（此速度可通过 "
":ref:`PILOT_SPD_UP<PILOT_SPD_UP>` 和 :ref:`PILOT_SPD_DN<PILOT_SPD_DN>` "
"参数调整）。达到这些速度所用的加速度由 :ref:`PILOT_ACC_Z<PILOT_ACC_Z>` 设置。"

#: ../../source/docs/follow-mode.rst:16 30bcfe3ea555426db1c23177ac71c712
msgid ""
"The following parameters can be used to tune Follow Mode's performance:"
msgstr "以下参数可用于调整 Follow 模式的性能："

#: ../../source/docs/follow-mode.rst:18 3e3a68bdd937440998a8d5aea6fb129e
msgid ""
":ref:`FOLL_ENABLE <FOLL_ENABLE>`: set to 1 to enable follow mode and refresh"
" parameters"
msgstr ":ref:`FOLL_ENABLE <FOLL_ENABLE>`：设为 1 以启用 Follow 模式并刷新参数"

#: ../../source/docs/follow-mode.rst:19 e575e76e0d964928865ff9a3a4a368be
msgid ""
":ref:`FOLL_SYSID <FOLL_SYSID>`: MAVLink system id of lead vehicle (\"0\" "
"means follow the first vehicle \"seen\")"
msgstr ":ref:`FOLL_SYSID <FOLL_SYSID>`：目标飞行器的 MAVLink 系统 ID（\"0\"表示跟随第一个\"发现\"的飞行器）"

#: ../../source/docs/follow-mode.rst:20 ca81d6638c144512bcc0ae8bdfa7ea6d
msgid ""
":ref:`FOLL_DIST_MAX <FOLL_DIST_MAX>`: if lead vehicle is more than this many"
" meters away, give up on following and hold position"
msgstr ":ref:`FOLL_DIST_MAX <FOLL_DIST_MAX>`：如果目标飞行器距离超过此距离（米），则放弃跟随并保持位置"

#: ../../source/docs/follow-mode.rst:21 f8f38a43b73346ab8ff00bd98b15238d
msgid ""
":ref:`FOLL_OFS_X <FOLL_OFS_X>`, :ref:`FOLL_OFS_Y <FOLL_OFS_Y>`, "
":ref:`FOLL_OFS_Z <FOLL_OFS_Z>`: 3D offset (in meters) from the lead vehicle"
msgstr ""
":ref:`FOLL_OFS_X <FOLL_OFS_X>`、:ref:`FOLL_OFS_Y "
"<FOLL_OFS_Y>`、:ref:`FOLL_OFS_Z <FOLL_OFS_Z>`：相对于目标飞行器的 3D 偏移量（单位：米）"

#: ../../source/docs/follow-mode.rst:22 e2187232f21a42a7a306607c6d2b5436
msgid ""
":ref:`FOLL_OFS_TYPE <FOLL_OFS_TYPE>`: set to 0 if offsets are North-East-"
"Down, 1 if offsets are relative to lead vehicle's heading"
msgstr ""
":ref:`FOLL_OFS_TYPE <FOLL_OFS_TYPE>`：如果偏移量为北东下坐标系，设为 0；如果偏移量相对于目标飞行器的航向，设为 1"

#: ../../source/docs/follow-mode.rst:23 060a0bb23aff46a893c84ea8eabbb58e
msgid ""
":ref:`FOLL_YAW_BEHAVE <FOLL_YAW_BEHAVE>`: controls whether follow points in "
"the same direction as lead vehicle or always towards it"
msgstr ""
":ref:`FOLL_YAW_BEHAVE <FOLL_YAW_BEHAVE>`：控制跟随时是朝向与目标飞行器相同的方向，还是始终朝向目标飞行器"

#: ../../source/docs/follow-mode.rst:24 0663116b099741858f5a76ae13ad12fa
msgid ""
":ref:`FOLL_POS_P <FOLL_POS_P>`: gain which controls how aggressively this "
"vehicle moves towards lead vehicle (limited by :ref:`WP_SPD<WP_SPD>`)"
msgstr ""
":ref:`FOLL_POS_P <FOLL_POS_P>`：控制本飞行器向领队飞行器移动的积极程度的增益（受 "
":ref:`WP_SPD<WP_SPD>` 限制）"

#: ../../source/docs/follow-mode.rst:25 64aa580e3a6846f5a6bbdb1d7ffc4871
msgid ""
":ref:`FOLL_ALT_TYPE <FOLL_ALT_TYPE>`: allows selecting whether to use lead "
"vehicle's relative-to-home or relative-to-sea-level altitude"
msgstr ":ref:`FOLL_ALT_TYPE <FOLL_ALT_TYPE>`：允许选择使用目标飞行器相对于 Home 或相对于海平面的高度"

#: ../../source/docs/follow-mode.rst:26 64fa4763c7e24ebaa1b4b8d981321517
msgid ""
":ref:`FOLL_OPTIONS<FOLL_OPTIONS>`: set bit 0 to \"1\" to enable the "
":ref:`common-mount-targeting` to follow the target vehicle."
msgstr ""
":ref:`FOLL_OPTIONS<FOLL_OPTIONS>`：将第 0 位设为\"1\"以启用 :ref:`common-mount-"
"targeting` 跟随目标飞行器。"
